5,1,1,talk,Minato,,Hello everyone. I want to make sure the person who handles the money doesn't have too much work. What should we look at first?,"{""words"":24,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,1,1,talk,Ryuji,,We need a realistic view of our finances. I suggest we start with the actual numbers before we decide on a structure.,"{""words"":22,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,1,1,talk,Minako,,I agree. We should be careful not to disrupt the welcoming atmosphere for new members while we fix the fees.,"{""words"":20,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,1,1,talk,May,,Let's make sure the new system doesn't make people hesitate to come to our evenings. It should feel easy and inviting!,"{""words"":21,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,1,1,talk,Shunichi,,I'm more interested in who is actually showing up. It's time we see if the burden of attendance is as uneven as it feels.,"{""words"":24,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
10,1,2,talk,Minato,,"I'll check the ""Outgoing treasurer's logged hours"" and ""Sign-up records for mid-year joiners"" to see how hard the bookkeeping is.","{""words"":20,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
11,1,2,talk,Ryuji,,"I will examine the ""Last year's ledger of outgoings"" and ""Bank statements on last year's renewals"" to see our actual cash flow.","{""words"":22,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
12,1,2,talk,Minako,,"I'll look into the ""Minute books from the named-grade years"" and ""Taster evening forms from non-joiners"" to see how different structures affect joining.","{""words"":23,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
13,1,2,talk,May,,"I want to know why people are hesitant. I'll check ""Weekday turnout since the summer outings"" and ""Quieter members at the winter social.""","{""words"":23,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
14,1,2,talk,Shunichi,,"I'll take the ""Tally of the sign-in sheets"" and ""The rota against the attendance record"" to quantify the imbalance.","{""words"":19,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
